From c5a0ef7f016a2a61ca3ea1280347a998a8a4aabe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MF KVM v3 <mf-kvm@localhost>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:58:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add ST7789V2 170x320 landscape as a build-time SPI panel
 choice

disp_type 2 stays "the SPI colour panel", and CONFIG_KVM_SPI_PANEL picks
which one. GC9A01 is the default. The console, the stored NVS index and the
pin settings are unchanged. Adds Kconfig defaults for disp_enable, disp_type
and disp_bl, all at their old values.

Layout lives in st7789_ui.c, apart from the panel I/O, so a host test can
render it. Not run on a panel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y2gafkZviHqY45NzkXoZ7C
